/* ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   TEMU KPI v6 (2026-06-19) — DEFINITIVE card visuals (overrides every earlier
   TEMU layer). Robust transform-based rotating border ring + drifting credit-card
   gradient interior (no @property dependency), staggered opening animation,
   centred cards with full (un-truncated) labels, Volume-trend-style filter chips,
   trend-style chart background, glow on the selected card.
