     5) wide smooth diagonal sheen (anchored)
     6) base hue foil: amber → coral → magenta → violet → indigo (anchored) */
  background:
    linear-gradient(180deg,
      rgba(255,255,255,0.50) 0%,
      rgba(255,255,255,0.12) 26%,
      rgba(255,255,255,0.00) 50%,
      rgba(6,2,14,0.14) 80%,
